{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13101260","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13101260","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:3:1310126001:0":{"text":"Dura above, oh goddess.... may she watch over us and keep us safe from evil...","source_cn":"……艾雅在上，尊您神名……愿您注视着大地，救我们脱离凶恶……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2CC82583D82F8A20","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1310126002:0":{"text":"Ha! Still remembering your prayers, huh? You're tougher than you look, kid!","source_cn":"嚯，还记得祈祷，看来你没什么事啊！小伙子不错，胆子很大！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x89BF776401EC30CA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1310126003:0":{"text":"I... honestly, I was just scared out of my mind. Praying to Dura just made me feel a bit braver...","source_cn":"我……其实我害怕得很……想着向艾雅祈祷……壮壮胆……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7560B1E4282D627A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1310126004:1":{"text":"Plus, that hunter went after the undead, so that helped ease my fear.","source_cn":"而且，白狼兄弟去追击活死人了，我……我也不用太害怕……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x860E1D74C0D1B7AE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:7:1310126004":{"text":"Plus, that hunter went after the undead, so that helped ease my fear.","